    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">variations in our and our competitors&rsquo; results of operations;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
