<A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022038374/ea162654-6k_canfitebio.htm">July 11, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022041319/ea163210-6k_canfitebio.htm">July 25, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022048806/ea164577-6k_canfite.htm">August 17, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022049857/ea164761-6k_canfite.htm">August 22, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022050265/ea164844-6k_canfite.htm">August 23, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022050926/ea164764-6k_canfite.htm">August 25, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022051819/ea165101-6k_canfite.htm">August 29, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022054533/ea165455-6k_canfite.htm">September 7, 2022</A>,
<A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022055188/ea165497-6k_canfite.htm">September 12, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022065967/ea167507-6k_canfitebio.htm">October 25, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022068409/ea167928-6k_canfitebio.htm">November 2, 2022,</A> <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022075036/ea169276-6k_canfitebio.htm">November 25, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022078337/ea169841-6k_canfitebio.htm">December 8, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022083033/ea170927-6k_canfitebio.htm">December 28, 2022</A>, <A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390022084078/ea170981-6k_canfitebio.htm">December 30, 2022</A>, and
<A HREF="http://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1536196/000121390023001831/ea171478-6k_canfitebio.htm">January 10, 2023</A> (in each case, to the extent expressly incorporated by reference into our effective registration statements on Form
